  "description": "With its 120 mm travel and a balanced trail geometry, the Ground Control 3 becomes your new playful partner for exciting MTB adventures. The combination of the high-quality DT Swiss XM 1700 Spline wheelset and the Maxxis Forekaster EXO TR tyres impresses on even the most demanding trails with the right balance between traction and rolling resistance, so that you will always have a sure-footed feel. The travel of the e*thirteen Vario Infinite Vario seat post can be shortened by 30 mm in just a few steps and can thus be optimally adjusted to your needs. * approx. 13.3 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for evil pepper green frame, size M, without pedals",
